<title>USA: CME average feeder steer price.</title>
<headline>CME average feeder steer price.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Chicago Mercantile Exchange reported  the average feeder steer price for the seven calendar days ending  Thursday, July 31 used for cash settlement of CME Feeder Cattle contracts.  (in dollars per cwt) --</p>
<p>12-STATES - FOR 7 DAYS ENDING -</p>
<p>Thursday	 July 31 $82.37   up 0.06</p>
<p>Wednesday	July 30 $82.31   dn 0.15</p>
<p>Tuesday	  July 29 $82.46   up 0.08</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8720))</p>
</text>
